Project a radius 3 electric field from your shield lasting 4 turns. Enemies within this field will take an automatic shield strike for [37%, 45%, 50%, 55%, 60% (TL1-5; SHIELD BLOCK 200)] lightning damage each turn, while allies will gain flat damage reduction equal to [10%, 23%, 31%, 38%, 43% (TL1-5; SHIELD BLOCK 200)] ([20, 46, 63, 77, 87 (TL1-5; SHIELD BLOCK 200)]) of block value.

All damage reduced by this effect will be stored for Capacitor Discharge.
